// A. 用户子系统 E-R 图
// 渲染命令: dot -Tpng ER图_1_用户子系统.dot -o ER图_1_用户子系统.png
digraph ER_User {
    graph [
        rankdir=LR,
        fontname="Microsoft YaHei",
        fontsize=16,
        label="A. 用户子系统 E-R 图",
        labelloc=t,
        nodesep=0.5,
        ranksep=1.0
    ];
    node [fontname="Microsoft YaHei", fontsize=11];
    edge [fontname="Microsoft YaHei", fontsize=10, arrowhead=none];

    // 实体
    schools   [shape=box, label="schools",   style=filled, fillcolor="#EFF6FF"];
    users      [shape=box, label="users",     style=filled, fillcolor="#EFF6FF"];
    locations [shape=box, label="locations", style=filled, fillcolor="#EFF6FF"];

    // 主码属性（椭圆，下划线）
    pk_schools   [shape=ellipse, style=filled, fillcolor=white, label=<<U>id</U>>];
    pk_users     [shape=ellipse, style=filled, fillcolor=white, label=<<U>id</U>>];
    pk_locations [shape=ellipse, style=filled, fillcolor=white, label=<<U>id</U>>];

    // 联系（菱形）
    R_register [shape=diamond, style=filled, fillcolor=white, label="注册", fontsize=10, width=0.9, height=0.5];
    R_contain  [shape=diamond, style=filled, fillcolor=white, label="包含", fontsize=10, width=0.9, height=0.5];

    // 实体—主码
    schools -> pk_schools;
    users -> pk_users;
    locations -> pk_locations;

    // schools (1) — 注册 — (n) users
    schools -> R_register [taillabel="1", labeldistance=1.5];
    R_register -> users   [headlabel="n", labeldistance=1.5];

    // schools (1) — 包含 — (n) locations
    schools -> R_contain  [taillabel="1", labeldistance=1.5];
    R_contain -> locations [headlabel="n", labeldistance=1.5];
}
